    room/model.py          what the transcript adds up to: who is where, the covenant page,
                           memories, declarations, offers
    room/log.py            the transcript itself (one SQLite file per room)
    room/console.py        the operator's console, and seat links
    room/static/           the console page and the seat page
    room/human.py          a person's seat in a terminal; its reply format
    room/rendezvous.py     seats reached over the network
